  "overview": "Mineral UI — an open-source design system for modern software experiences.",
  "dos": "- **Surface & Theme Polarity**: Crisp light (#ffffff) canvas paired with `#ffffff` component surfaces and `#0b0b0c` primary ink.\n- **Brand & Interactive Accent**: Primary actions and focus states anchor on `#accbfc` with `#0b0b0c` label contrast.\n- **Typographic Voice**: Headings and UI controls set in `Open Sans` across 7 type steps.\n- **Component Geometry**: Buttons (`8px`), cards (`12px`), inputs, badges, and navigation bars share consistent spacing and border contrast."
